---

Some animations in this project were informed by the motion design of
pqoqubbw/icons, used under the MIT License. No code or artwork was copied: those
icons are built on Lucide, whose drawings and coordinate space differ from
Phosphor's, so what was adopted is the choreographic approach — which part of an
icon moves, and in what manner — re-expressed in this project's own vocabulary.
Icons drawing on that work carry an inline note.

